<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/14/eng@/~cl_25> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 355 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for subsection 355(10) the following subsection: “ (10) To the extent that any of the amount obtained under paragraph (3)(e) or subsection (9) has not been distributed due to the difficulty of ascertaining or notifying the aggrieved persons, such amount shall be— (a) paid to the Capital Market Compensation Fund maintained under Part IV; or (b) retained by the Commission to defray— (i) the cost of developing and facilitating educational programmes for capital market investors and professionals; or (ii) the cost of regulating the capital market, as the Commission, with the approval of the Minister, may determine.”. Amendment of section 356"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/14/eng@> .
