<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/14/eng@/~cl_7> <https://schema.org/text> "Subsection 105(3) of the principal Act is amended by deleting the words “and section 106”. Deletion of section 106"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/14/eng@> .
